<span id="S3.T2.6.5.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:369.9pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.6.5.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T2.6.5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">A photo of a woman putting her arm around a man’s shoulder, in an open green park, Ultra HD quality.</span></span>
