<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A0.T11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 11</span>: </span><span id="A0.T11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Prompting template for different types of inputs to GPT<span id="A0.T11.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. For each evaluation aspect, we selectively determined whether to provide the text prompt <math id="A0.T11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}</annotation></semantics></math>, the reference images <math id="A0.T11.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}</annotation></semantics></math>, or neither with the generated image <math id="A0.T11.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{g}</annotation></semantics></math>, and accordingly made slight adjustments to the prompting templates.</span></span></figcaption>
